["by Śrīla Lochan Dās Ṭhākur"],"verses":[{"number":"1","text":["ke yābi ke yābi bhāi bhava-sindhu pāra","dhanya kali-yuge re chaitanya-avatāra"],"translation":["Who will cross, O brother, who will cross the ocean of material existence? Oh! The fortune of this Age of Kali is the appearance of Śrī Chaitanya."],"isLong":false},{"number":"2","text":["āmāra gaurāṅger ghāṭe ujānakheyā vaya","kaḍipāti nāhi lāge amani pāra haya"],"translation":["At my Lord Gaurāṅga’s ghāṭ the upstream ferry runs without requesting any fare. Everyone crosses freely."],"isLong":false},{"number":"3","text":["hari-nāmera tarīkhāni śrī-guru-kāṇḍārī","saṅkīrtana-keroyāla du’bāhu pasāri"],"translation":["The Lord’s Names are the ferryboat, Śrī Guru is the captain, and the outstretched arms in the saṅkīrtan are the oars."],"isLong":false},{"number":"4","text":["sarva-jīva uddhāra haila premera vātāse","lochana paḍiyā raila karamera doṣe"],"translation":["All souls have thus been delivered by the winds of divine love. Only Lochan Dās has fallen and remained behind, as a result of his sins."],"isLong":false}],"resources":{"audio":[{"title":"Srila B.K. Ashram Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/scsmathcolombia/12-ke-jabi-ke-jabi","personSlug":"srila-b-k-ashram-maharaj"},{"title":"Manasa Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/huron/ke-jabi","personSlug":"manasa-krishna-prabhu"}]},"hasWbw":false,"hasVersesText":true,"hasVersesTranslations":true,"hasLongVerses":false,"fullInlineWbw":false},"telegraphUrl":"https://telegra.ph/Ke-yābi-ke-yābi-02-22"},"head":{"canonical":"/en-pe/ke-jabi-ke-jabi-bhai-bhava-sindhu-para/","description":"Ke yābi ke yābi — a Vaiṣṇava song by Śrīla Lochan Dās Ṭhākur with lyrics, English translation and word-by-word meaning. From Pocket Kirtan Guide.","title":"Ke yābi ke yābi. by Śrīla Lochan Dās Ṭhākur | Kirtan Site"},"kind":"song","route":{"kind":"item","bookId":"en-pe","slug":"ke-jabi-ke-jabi-bhai-bhava-sindhu-para"}}